/*
  Localizable.strings (English, development language)

  SwiftUI looks up every string literal passed to Text, Label, Button,
  navigationTitle, TextField, Toggle, Section and similar views as a key in
  this table. Interpolations become format specifiers: an integer is %lld,
  a String is %@, and a literal percent sign is %%.

  A key that is missing here still renders (as the key itself, which is the
  English text). A translation adds <lang>.lproj/Localizable.strings with
  the same keys.
*/

